  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Primary Productivity in Offshore Areas",
  "description": "Measurements of primary productivity. In addition to cruise information, position, date, time, sampling depth and environmental information, this file may contain measured parameters of nutrients, chlorophyll a and carbon assimilation. Also included are data from the Outer Continental Shelf Environmental Assessment Program. On-line documentation is available on the NOSIE system located on the NODC VAX computer and the NODC User's guide.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: The data are collected to provide information on nutrient levels and nutrient flow in offshore areas.",
